usage: sdp <card|board|doctor|dispatch|result|orchestrate|attention|bootstrap> <subcommand> [flags]

Card commands:
  sdp card <create|show|clarify|needs-input|ready|park|execute|heartbeat|feedback|feedback-export|message-export|resume|resume-import|reply-ingest|deliver>

Board commands:
  sdp board <build|show>

Doctor commands:
  sdp doctor control

Dispatch commands:
  sdp dispatch card
  sdp dispatch next

Result commands:
  sdp result ingest

Orchestrate commands:
  sdp orchestrate once

Query commands (require beads/dual mode):
  sdp why <card-id>           Show why a card is blocked
  sdp next [--limit N]        Show next actionable items (default 10)
  sdp missing [project-id]    Show items lacking evidence
  sdp approve <card-id>       Resolve a human gate
  sdp trace <card-id>         Show full feature trace

Deploy commands:
  sdp deploy staging [project-root]
  sdp deploy prod <staging-image-tag> [project-root]
  sdp deploy rollback <previous-tag> [project-root]

Discovery commands (Stage 0):
  sdp discover "raw idea"    Run discovery pipeline (FRAME + SCAN + checkpoint)

Pipeline commands:
  sdp intent "description"   Create intake card from raw intent
  sdp status <card-id>        Show card status and phase
  sdp stuck                  Show stuck/long-running cards
  sdp eval <card-id>         Run build evaluation manually
  sdp clarify <card-id>      Run clarification manually
  sdp plan <card-id>         Show plan for a card
  sdp approve-plan <card-id> Approve a pending plan

Other:
  sdp attention

Scout commands:
  sdp scout [--format json|text|card] [--output DIR] <repo-path>

Spec commands:
  sdp spec [--format json|text] [--category api|rules|invariants|sla] [--output DIR] [--enrich] [--diff] <repo-path>

Index commands:
  sdp index build [--format json|text] <repo-path>
  sdp index stats <repo-path>
  sdp index manifest [--output DIR] <repo-path>

Bootstrap commands:
  sdp bootstrap [--dry-run] [--force] [--yes] [--auto-curate] [--only TYPES] <repo-path>
  sdp bootstrap status <repo-path>
